    "UIName": "Commando",
    "Id": "chassisdef_commando_COM-QS1",
    "Name": "Commando",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Light PPC Sniper. The COM-QS1 has overwhelming firepower for a light mech, able to punch far above it's weight bracket. Just make sure to stay far away from the enemy; not only is the mech more reliant on stealth than armor, it's main gun does more damage the further away the enemy is.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.96</color></b>",
